{"id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appg-elementary-metric-geometry#def:chow-iii-g29-euclidean-cone","title":"def:chow-iii-g29-euclidean-cone","path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appg-elementary-metric-geometry.md","line":238,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appg-elementary-metric-geometry.tex#def:chow-iii-g29-euclidean-cone","uses":["[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appg-elementary-metric-geometry#def:chow-iii-g20-tangent-cone]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appg-elementary-metric-geometry.tex","label":"def:chow-iii-g29-euclidean-cone","line":351,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Euclidean metric cone]\n\\label{def:chow-iii-g29-euclidean-cone}\n\\source{chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-iii:page-0420}\n\\uses{def:chow-iii-g20-tangent-cone}\n\\dcref{appG:G.29}\\group{Metric cones}\n\nFor $\\diam(X,d)\\leq\\pi$, the Euclidean metric cone is the topological cone\nwith\n\\[\nd_{\\Cone(X)}([(x_1,r_1)],[(x_2,r_2)])=\n\\sqrt{r_1^2+r_2^2-2r_1r_2\\cos d(x_1,x_2)}.\n\\]\nRadial dilation by $c>0$ is a homothety.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Euclidean metric cone] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a63686f772d6969692d6732392d6575636c696465616e2d636f6e65\"></span> <span class=\"tex-source\" style=\"display:block\">Source: <span class=\"reference\">chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-iii:page-0420</span></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FChowEtAl%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fappg-elementary-metric-geometry%23def%3Achow-iii-g20-tangent-cone\">↗ def:chow-iii-g20-tangent-cone</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. appG:G.29</span></span>\\group Metric cones <p></p>For <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\diam (X,d)\\leq \\pi $\">$\\diam (X,d)\\leq \\pi $</span>, the Euclidean metric cone is the topological cone with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  d_{\\Cone (X)}([(x_1,r_1)],[(x_2,r_2)])= \\sqrt{r_1^2+r_2^2-2r_1r_2\\cos d(x_1,x_2)}.  \\]\">\\[  d_{\\Cone (X)}([(x_1,r_1)],[(x_2,r_2)])= \\sqrt{r_1^2+r_2^2-2r_1r_2\\cos d(x_1,x_2)}.  \\]</span> Radial dilation by <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$c&gt;0$\">$c&gt;0$</span> is a homothety. ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appg-elementary-metric-geometry#ex:chow-iii-g26-g27-asymptotic-examples","next":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appg-elementary-metric-geometry#prop:chow-iii-g30-g32-cone-metric","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appg-elementary-metric-geometry#def:chow-iii-g20-tangent-cone","title":"def:chow-iii-g20-tangent-cone","label":"def:chow-iii-g20-tangent-cone"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appg-elementary-metric-geometry#prop:chow-iii-g30-g32-cone-metric","title":"prop:chow-iii-g30-g32-cone-metric","label":"prop:chow-iii-g30-g32-cone-metric"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appg-elementary-metric-geometry#thm:chow-iii-g49-tangent-cone","title":"thm:chow-iii-g49-tangent-cone","label":"thm:chow-iii-g49-tangent-cone"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appj-selected-exercise-solutions#ex:chow-iii-appj-solution-i-14","title":"ex:chow-iii-appj-solution-i-14","label":"ex:chow-iii-appj-solution-i-14"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appg-elementary-metric-geometry#def:chow-iii-g29-euclidean-cone","title":"def:chow-iii-g29-euclidean-cone","tex":"\\begin{definition}[Euclidean metric cone]\n\\label